      "body": "Nureca Limited (NSEI:NURECA) announces a share repurchase program. Under the offer, the company will repurchase up to 580,000 shares, representing 5.8% of its share capital for INR 191.4 million worth of its equity shares. The shares will be repurchased at a price not exceeding INR 330 per share. The repurchases will be funded via cash. The company has fixed December 12, 2025, as the record date for the offer. As of November 21, 2025, the company had 1,00,00,175 issued and outstanding shares.",
